{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q23", "domain": "relationship", "question": "命主在那一年结婚？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主为甲木，生于丑月（冬季），木寒且土旺，需火暖局、木疏土。命局中丁火透出（年、时柱），但火无根，需大运或流年引动。\n\n分析婚姻（以正财为妻星，男命以正财为配偶星）：\n- 日主甲木，正财为己土（妻星）。原局月支丑中藏己土，但未透干，妻星不显，需大运或流年引出。\n- 大运：2019年起行己酉运（正财），妻星己土透出，此运利于婚恋。\n- 流年：\n  - 2016年丙申：食神生财，但申金冲寅（日支子水无冲），且丙火透出，但申子半合水局，水旺木浮，婚缘不稳。\n  - 2017年丁酉：伤官见官（酉为正官），且酉金与日支子水相破，感情易有波折，非婚期。\n  - 2021年辛丑：正官透干，丑土为财库，且丑为妻星己土之根，流年与月柱癸丑伏吟，引动妻星，且大运己酉与流年辛丑半合金局（酉丑合金），金为官杀，官星旺而妻星得生，此年婚缘信息强烈。\n  - 2022年壬寅：偏印透出，寅木为比肩，与年时卯木会木局，身旺夺财，不利婚。\n\n综合判断，2021年（辛丑）正官合身，财星得根，且大运正财透出，婚缘成熟，最可能结婚。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "564c5345e723934d25ef4ddb5654a5261cfa650420fd36a38fbdd590086fb8e6", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19880110_P005-Q23", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_on_limited_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5450, "response_id": "655ab2e2-23cf-4a96-8929-6245bc173f32", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 457, "completion_tokens": 407, "total_tokens": 864, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 73}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash",