{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", "domain": "unknown", "question": "命主在2021年，发生何事？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "A", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：日主壬水生于申月得令，年柱癸丑、时柱壬子，水势极旺，身强无疑。月柱庚申偏印生身，全局金水两旺，喜火土为用神，忌金水。\n\n2021年辛丑，流年天干辛金为正印，地支丑土为正官。丑土为湿土，内藏癸水（劫财）、辛金（正印）、己土（正官），与年柱癸丑伏吟，且与月柱庚申暗合（申丑遁合），加重金水之气。大运乙卯（2018-2027），伤官透干，流年辛金正印克制乙木伤官，形成“伤官见印”之象，主事业受阻、计划中断、名誉受损。\n\n命局水旺，流年丑土本为用神，但被申金合化，且丑中癸水透出，土性被泄，用神无力。时柱壬子水势汹涌，流年辛丑引动水旺，水多木漂（乙卯大运之木被辛金克、被水泛），主财运破败、投资失利。2021年正值疫情后期，命主为马来西亚商人，水旺无制，主流动性资金断裂，生意难以维持。\n\n综合判断，此年最符合“生意下跌、资金周转不灵、倒闭”之象。选项B（歹徒刺伤）需看七杀或血光，但流年无强金克木或火土冲战，不显；选项C（母亲病疫）需看印星受克，但印星辛金得生，不主母灾；选项D（蒸蒸日上）与用神受制相反。\n\n最终答案：A", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 0.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "f046f8191079c8a47c9c663fad1a34ff01be0a83f96da9755b1ecef5b28f9c5c", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q29", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_on_limited_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5257, "response_id": "9519ccae-3b14-4db0-a7f8-06d4b0bed05e", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 453, "completion_tokens": 392, "total_tokens": 845, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 69}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinkin