{"case_id": "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", "domain": "health", "question": "命主在2024年的健康状况如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字：日主壬水生于申月得令，年柱癸丑、时柱壬子，水势极旺，金水两旺而木火弱。2024年甲辰，流年天干甲木食神透出，地支辰土为水库，与日支辰土伏吟，加重水势。水过旺则易泛滥，对应身体上水主肾、膀胱，但过旺反克火（心）和土（脾胃），且水多木漂，甲木食神受旺水冲击，食神主消化、饮食，也主呼吸系统。辰辰自刑，土气受伤，土主肌肉、脾胃，也主骨骼（土生金，金主骨，但土弱则骨失养）。命主大运在乙卯（45-54岁），伤官运，伤官主放纵、不节制，流年甲木食神又透，食伤混杂，易有饮食无度或不良嗜好。结合水旺木漂，甲木食神被旺水所泄，木主肝胆、筋骨，但此处更偏向于因水势过旺导致身体沉重、代谢不畅，且辰辰自刑有久坐不动之象（辰为湿土，主停滞）。综合判断，最符合的是因水旺土弱、久坐湿滞导致的脊椎问题，而非突发意外或特定器官病变。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "5c9eb27c14621acf85859cf8f26051052f37788afc0d9bca69a982d8eab48469", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2025_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on_limited", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "malaysia_male_19730824_P006-Q30", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent\\docs\\phase6\\6d-v2\\runs\\phase6-6d-v2-20260810-r1\\dev\\2025_b1a_time_on_limited_r1_g1\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5021, "response_id": "d8e9f174-2116-4f35-a92b-5ecab52aa213", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 450, "completion_tokens": 305, "total_tokens": 755, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 384}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 384, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 66}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
